eparated with comma(,)","conditionModalValues.emptyInputMessage":"Add valid condition value","addStatementControl.buttonText":"Add new statement","removeStatementControl.buttonText":"Remove","removeStatementControl.buttonAriaLabel":"Remove the current statement - {index}","removeStatementControl.buttonAriaLabelDisabled":"Remove button is disabled","removeStatementModal.title":"Remove {statement}?","removeStatementModal.body":"Are you sure you want to remove the statement?","errors":"Errors","warnings":"Warnings","errorBoundaryHeader":"Error rendering Policy Editor","actionList.listOnly":"Access level - list","actionList.readOnly":"Access level - read","actionList.readWrite":"Access level - read or write","actionList.permissions":"Access level - permissions","actionList.tagging":"Access level - tagging","controlPanel.noStatementSelected":"Select an existing statement in the policy or add a new statement.","serviceList.included":"Included","serviceList.available":"Available","dataLoader.loaded":"Loaded","dataLoader.error":"Error","dataLoader.typeEditor":"Editor","dataLoader.typeActions":"Actions","dataLoader.typeResources":"Resources","dataLoader.typeConditions":"Conditions","dataLoader.typeContextKeys":"Context Keys","dataLoader.unknown":"Unknown","permissionModalPermissionsHeader":"Permissions","bidirectionalMessage":"Your policy contained bidirectional characters which are invisible. We removed these characters for you. Policies that are copied from other sources can contain characters that can introduce errors.","bidirectionalCloseButton":"Silence error","bidirectionalHeader":"Policy contains bidirectional characters","homoglyphMessage":"Some characters used in your policy are homoglyphs, which fall outside the range of common characters. Confirm that the characters that you use in your policy element values are in the same format as the characters that you use for their resources. For example, use the same format for the name of a resource as you do for the ARN that you specify for that resource.","homoglyphCloseButton":"Silence warning","homoglyphHeader":"Policy contains homoglyphs","textUnder":"{size} of {limit} characters remaining","textAt":"Limit of {limit} characters has been reached","textOver":"Exceeds character limit by {size}","bytesUnder":"{size} of {limit} KiB remaining","bytesAt":"Limit of {limit} KiB has been reached","bytesOver":"{size} bytes exceeding limit","bytesPopover":"Policy exceeding the {limit} KiB limit can\'t be saved. Optimize the policy for size or create additional policy with the excess characters. ","info":"Info","textPopover":"Policy exceeding the {limit} characters limit can\'t be saved. Optimize the policy for size or create additional policy with the excess characters.","numberOfResultsFound":"{number} results found","close":"Close","moreInformationForAction":"More information about {actionName}","policyContainsErrorSecurityWarningAndWarning":"Your policy contains {errorCount} errors, {securityWarningCount} security warnings and {warningCount} warnings","policyContainsErrorAndSecurityWarning":"Your policy contains {errorCount} errors and {securityWarningCount} security warnings","policyContainsErrorAndWarning":"Your policy contains {errorCount} errors and {warningCount} warnings","policyContainsSecurityWarningAndWarning":"Your policy contains {securityWarningCount} security warnings and {warningCount} warnings","policyContainsError":"Your policy contains {errorCount} errors","policyContainsSecurityWarning":"Your policy contains {securityWarningCount} security warnings","policyContainsWarning":"Your policy contains {warningCount} warnings","filterActions":"Search actions","clearFilterActions":"Clear filter and display all actions for the service","filterServices":"Search services","clearFilterServices":"Clear filter and display all available services","matches":"{count} matches","learnMoreAboutValidation":"Learn more about policy validation","clearSearchLabel":"Clear"},"whatsNewWidget":{"features.iam":"{\\"feature0\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"Amazon Bedrock introduces API keys for streamlined development\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/07/amazon-bedrock-api-keys-for-streamlined-development\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"07/08/2025\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2025-07-08T19:34:00Z\\"}, \\"feature1\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"AWS Service Reference Information now supports annotations for service actions\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/06/aws-service-reference-information-annotations/\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"06/26/2025\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2025-06-26T10:00:00-07:00\\"}, \\"feature2\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"AWS expands resource control policies (RCPs) support to two additional services\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/06/aws-resource-control-policies-additional-services\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"06/19/2025\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2025-06-19T13:00:00-04:00\\"}, \\"feature3\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"AWS IAM now enforces MFA for root users across all account types\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/06/aws-iam-mfa-root-users-across-all-account-types/\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"06/17/2025\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2025-06-17T10:00:00-04:00\\"}, \\"feature4\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"Amazon EKS Pod Identity simplifies the experience for cross-account access\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/06/amazon-eks-pod-identity-cross-account-access\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"06/12/2025\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2025-06-12T13:00:00-05:00\\"}, \\"feature5\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"Amazon EBS now supports additional resource-level permissions for copying EBS snapshots\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/04/amazon-ebs-additional-resource-level-permissions-copying-eb-snapshots\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"04/22/2025\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2025-04-22T15:15:00-04:00\\"}, \\"feature6\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"AWS Identity and Access Management now supports dual-stack (IPv4 and IPv6) environments\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/03/aws-identity-access-management-dual-stack-ipv4-ipv6-environments\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"03/28/2025\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2025-03-28T16:40:00-04:00\\"}, \\"feature7\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"AWS Service Reference Information now supports resources and condition keys\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/03/aws-service-reference-information-resources-condition-keys\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"03/13/2025\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2025-03-13T13:00:00-04:00\\"}, \\"feature8\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"IAM Access Analyzer now supports Internet Protocol Version 6 (IPv6)\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/03/iam-access-analyzer-supports-ipv6/\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"03/05/2025\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2025-03-05T10:00:00-08:00\\"}, \\"feature9\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"Amazon RDS now provides visibility into IAM DB Authentication metrics and logs\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/02/amazon-rds-visibility-iam-db-authentication-metrics-logs\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"02/26/2025\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2025-02-26T17:00:00-05:00\\"}, \\"feature10\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"Amazon ECS adds support for additional IAM condition keys\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/02/amazon-ecs-additional-iam-condition-keys\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"02/26/2025\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2025-02-26T13:00:00-05:00\\"}, \\"feature11\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"AWS IAM announces support for encrypted SAML assertions \\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/02/aws-iam-encrypted-saml-assertions/\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"02/05/2025\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2025-02-05T10:00:00-08:00\\"}, \\"feature12\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"AWS CodeBuild announces support for project ARN and build ARN IAM condition keys\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2025/01/aws-codebuild-project-arn-build-arn-iam-condition-keys\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"01/28/2025\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2025-01-28T16:50:00-05:00\\"}, \\"feature13\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"IAM Roles Anywhere credential helper now supports TPM 2.0\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/12/iam-roles-anywhere-credential-helper-tpm-2-0\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"12/17/2024\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2024-12-17T14:50:00-05:00\\"}, \\"feature14\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"Announcing AWS STS support for ECDSA-based signatures of OIDC tokens\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/11/aws-sts-ecdsa-based-signatures-oidc-tokens\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"11/22/2024\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2024-11-22T15:15:00-05:00\\"}, \\"feature15\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"Amazon EKS simplifies providing IAM permissions to EKS add-ons\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/11/amazon-eks-iam-permissions-eks-add-ons\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"11/18/2024\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2024-11-18T17:00:00-05:00\\"}, \\"feature16\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"Centrally manage root access in AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM)\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/11/manage-root-access-aws-identity-access-management/\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"11/15/2024\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2024-11-15T10:00:00-08:00\\"}, \\"feature17\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"Customize scope of IAM Access Analyzer unused access analysis  \\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/11/customize-scope-iam-access-analyzer-unused-access-analysis/\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"11/14/2024\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2024-11-14T10:00:00-08:00\\"}, \\"feature18\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"Introducing resource control policies (RCPs) to centrally restrict access to AWS resources\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/11/resource-control-policies-restrict-access-aws-resources/\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"11/13/2024\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2024-11-13T10:00:00-08:00\\"}, \\"feature19\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"AWS IAM now supports PrivateLink in the AWS GovCloud (US) Regions\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/11/aws-iam-privatelink-govcloud-us-regions\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"11/08/2024\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2024-11-08T13:00:00-05:00\\"}, \\"feature20\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"Streamline automation of policy management workflows with service reference information\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/10/streamline-automation-policy-management-workflows-service-reference-information\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"10/10/2024\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2024-10-10T13:00:00-04:00\\"}, \\"feature21\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"Amazon S3 Access Grants introduce the ListCallerAccessGrants API\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/09/amazon-s3-access-grants-listcalleraccessgrants-api\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"09/05/2024\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2024-09-05T17:50:00-04:00\\"}, \\"feature22\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"AWS Identity and Access Management now supports AWS PrivateLink in all commercial Regions\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/08/aws-identity-access-management-aws-privatelink-regions/\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"08/22/2024\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2024-08-22T10:00:00-07:00\\"}, \\"feature23\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"AWS Identity and Access Management simplifies management of OpenID Connect identity providers\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/07/aws-identity-access-management-open-id-connect-identity-providers\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"07/12/2024\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2024-07-12T16:30:00-04:00\\"}, \\"feature24\\": {\\"headline\\": \\"AWS IAM Access Analyzer now offers policy checks for public and critical resource access\\", \\"headlineUrl\\": \\"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/06/aws-iam-access-analyzer-policy-checks\\", \\"postDateTime\\": \\"06/11/2024\\", \\"absoluteDateTime\\": \\"2024-06-11T08:00:00-04:00\\"}}","today":" Today","yesterday":" Yesterday","daysAgo":" {day} days ago","weekAgo":" 1 week ago","weeksAgo":" {week} weeks ago","monthAgo":" 1 month ago","monthsAgo":" {month} months ago","yearAgo":" 1 year ago","header":"What\'s new","description":"Updates for features in IAM","viewAll":"View all","viewAllAria":"View all about What\'s New","more":"more","less":"less","moreAria":"Show more results","lessAria":"Show fewer results"},"mfaListWidget":{"mfaListLoadingText":"Loading","mfaListTableHeader":"Multi-factor authentication (MFA)","mfaListTableHeaderDescription":"As a best practice, use MFA to increase the security of your AWS environments. Signing in to MFA-protected accounts requires a user name, password, and an authentication code from an MFA device.","remove":"Remove","resync":"Resync","assignMfa":"Assign MFA","noDevice":"No MFA devices","noDeviceDescription":"Add an MFA device to increase the security of your AWS environment","deleteMFAModal":"Remove MFA device?","deleteMFAContent":"You won\'t be required to provide MFA codes when they sign in.","cancel":"Cancel","resyncMFATitle":"Resync MFA device","resyncMFAContent":"Fill in two consecutive codes from your MFA device to resynchronize it.","resyncInput1":"MFA code 1","resyncInput2":"MFA code 2"},"selectMFADevice":{"virtualDesc":"Authenticate using a code generated by an app installed on your mobile device or computer.","u2fDesc":"Authenticate using a code generated by touching a YubiKey or other supported U2F device.","hardwareDesc":"Authenticate using a code displayed on a hardware Time-based one-time password (TOTP) token.","authenticatorApp":"Authenticator app","u2fSecurityKey":"U2F security key","hardwareDevice":"Hardware TOTP token","selectDevice":"Select MFA device","selectDeviceSmall":"Select an MFA device to use, in addition to your username and password, whenever you need to authenticate.","cancel":"Cancel","next":"Next"},"setupMFADevice":{"pageTitle":"Activate multi-factor authentication (MFA)","setupTitle":"Set up your authenticator app","virtualDesc":"A virtual MFA device is an application running on your device that you can configure by scanning a QR code.","install":"Install a compatible application such as Google Authenticator, Duo Mobile, or Authy app on your mobile device or computer.","list":"See a list of compatible applications","show":"Show QR code","step2Text":"Open your authenticator app, choose <b>Show QR code</b> on this page, then use the app to scan the code. Alternatively, you can type a secret key. <show>Show secret key</show>","step3Text":"Type two consecutive MFA codes below","code1":"Enter a code from your virtual app below","code2":"Wait 30 seconds, and enter a second code entry.","cancel":"Cancel","previous":"Previous","addMFA":"Add MFA","hardwareTitle":"Set up hardware MFA device","hardwareDescription":"For more information about using a hardware MFA device, see the <a>IAM User Guide</a>","hardwareLabel1":"Enter the device serial number located on the back of the device.","hardwareLabel2":"Press the button on the front of the device and enter the 6-digit number that appears.","hardwareLabel3":"Wait 30 seconds and then press the button again. Enter the second number.","serialNumber":"Serial number","MFACode1":"MFA Code 1","MFACode2":"MFA Code 2","u2fTitle":"Set up security key","u2fDesc":"Supported configurations for using security keys","u2fStep1":"Connect your security key to your device.","u2fStep2":"Tap the security key.","passkeySetupTitle":"Passkey or security key","passkeySetupDesc":"Passkeys enable you to securely sign in to your AWS Account using your fingerprint, face, device pin, or FIDO2 security key.","passkeySetupStep1Label":"Step 1 of 2","passkeySetupStep1":"Create a passkey on this device or if you’re using another device, connect it now.","passkeySetupStep2Label":"Step 2 of 2","passkeySetupStep2":"Follow instructions from your browser.","passkeySetupLoading":"Loading","waiting":"Waiting for security key...","tap":"Tap key","troubleShoot":"Troubleshoot MFA","u2fCompl