有的問題清單","noFindings":"無問題清單","noMatches":"無相符項目","reported":" 已報告","noFindingsReported":"未報告任何問題清單","existingErrorFinding":"現有的錯誤問題清單。","newErrorFinding":"新的錯誤問題清單。","searchAllFindings":"篩選所有問題清單","searchNewFindings":"篩選新的問題清單","searchResolvedFindings":"篩選已解決的問題清單","searchArchivedFindings":"篩選已封存的問題清單","searchExistingFindings":"篩選現有的問題清單","clearFilterButton":"清除篩選條件","groupPropertyText":"屬性","and":"和","analyserStatusCreating":"正在建立","analyserStatusFailed":"失敗","analyserStatusDisabled":"已停用","analyserZoneOfTrust":"信任區域","accountAnalyserLabel":"目前帳戶","organizationAnalyserLabel":"目前組織","orgUnitAnalyserLabel":"組織單位 (OU)","principalArn":"主體 ARN","orgId":"主體組織 ID","orgPaths":"主體組織路徑","sourceAccount":"來源帳戶","sourceArn":"來源 ARN","sourceIp":"來源 IP","sourceVpc":"來源 VPC","sourceVpce":"來源 VPCE","userId":"使用者 ID","kmsKey":"KMS 金鑰 ID","googleAud":"Google 對象","cognitoAud":"Cognito 對象","callerAccount":"發起人帳戶","facebookAppId":"Facebook 應用程式 ID","amazonAppId":"Amazon 應用程式 ID","lambdaEventSourceToken":"Lambda 事件來源字符","accessPoint":"存取點","bucketACL":"儲存貯體 ACL","bucketPolicy":"儲存貯體政策","principal.aws":"AWS 帳戶","principal.CanonicalUser":"正式使用者","principal.Federated":"聯合身分使用者","error":"錯誤","error.accessDenied":"拒絕存取","error.internalError":"內部錯誤","isPublic":"公有存取","true":"true","false":"false","externalPrincipal":"外部主體","previewStatus":"狀態預覽","condition":"條件","sharedThrough":"共用方式","accessLevel":"存取層級","findingID":"IAM Access Analyzer 中的問題清單 ID","details.description1.allPrincipals":"所有主體","an":"一個 ","withCondition":" 搭配條件。","has":" 有 ","have":" 有 ","noLonger":" 不再","access":" 存取","details.archived.footer1":"此問題清單符合封存規則。","details.archived.footer2":" 檢視 IAM Access Analyzer 封存規則","details.lessPermissions.footer1":"儲存之後，此主體將擁有較少的許可。","details.lessPermissions.footer2":"請參閱 IAM Access Analyzer 中的存取詳細資訊 ","allLabel":"全部","newLabel":"新的","changedLabel":"已變更","resolvedLabel":"已解決","archivedLabel":"已存檔","existingLabel":"現有","publicLabel":"公有","activeLabel":"作用中","ConflictException":"IAM Access Analy